(a) The community and regulatory affairs director may designate a city employee to serve as the film liaison. Said employee shall be employed in the city's community and regulatory affairs department and shall be responsible for administering the provisions of this article. If no film liaison is designated, then the community and regulatory affairs director shall serve as the film liaison.
