Whereas, pursuant to Act 421 of the 2016 session of the Georgia General Assembly (the "City Charter"), the City of South Fulton incorporated on May 1, 2017;
Whereas, pursuant to Section 7.16(b) of the City Charter, the City provided notice to Fulton County of its intent to collect any tax, fee, assessment, fine or forfeiture, other monies;
